Follow nonconforming or returned material to an actual disposition (@cs-returns: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @chemical-supply-systems, #source "../sources/Pharmaceutical-Starting-Materials-WHO.lingua#r_7H51215T44S69TD3R0499VMTTY", #source "../sources/Good-Storage-and-Distribution-WHO.lingua#r_64EPQ96J7NE7QCWQ28SPXJ8V4D", #source "../sources/Emissions-from-Storage-BREF.lingua#r_4QFPS62AY03WVQB72BMNJQGC43", #chemical-supply-systems "../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/environment/Reagent-solvent-catalyst-recovery-and-closed-loop-limits.lingua#r_58CA7PDF4F2TMB6G0V7VBGCPQN") { r_00A3Q2KZ6FB44RZEJMZJ7DQQWP
**Read:** [Good trade and distribution practices for pharmaceutical starting materials — WHO](../sources/Pharmaceutical-Starting-Materials-WHO.lingua#r_7H51215T44S69TD3R0499VMTTY), complete complaints, recall, returns and nonconforming-material sections; [Good storage and distribution practices for medical products — WHO](../sources/Good-Storage-and-Distribution-WHO.lingua#r_64EPQ96J7NE7QCWQ28SPXJ8V4D), the complete applicable return/stock-quality discussion; [Emissions from Storage — European Commission BREF](../sources/Emissions-from-Storage-BREF.lingua#r_4QFPS62AY03WVQB72BMNJQGC43), complete applicable handling and environmental-pathway chapters.

Describe a returned delivery or rejected lot without silently treating it as either usable stock or vanished mass. Preserve identity, quantity, condition/history, reason for return, contact system, decision evidence and receiving party. A material suitable for one recovery route may be unsuitable for a different user's process.

Read the complete WHO returned/nonconforming/recall sections and apply their evidential distinctions to a documented chemical case. Compare producer return, qualified reprocessing, another authorized use and final treatment/disposal. Repacking or relabelling alone does not establish a new grade or remove the history that caused rejection.

Close the material and package balances through the chosen disposition. Include transport, temporary storage, testing, responsibility and the time required to reach a decision. Examine whether an interruption creates more returns or expired stock and whether those streams overload the available recovery capacity. Build a disposition table that separates established technical capability, permitted institutional arrangement and unresolved proposal. A literature-based case can specify the required work and evidence without claiming the returned material has actually been processed or accepted.

**Continue:** [Evaluate chemical recovery through actual selectivity, quality and continuing losses](../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/environment/Reagent-solvent-catalyst-recovery-and-closed-loop-limits.lingua#r_58CA7PDF4F2TMB6G0V7VBGCPQN).

